ildren":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," DC 25, 1 hour of work) or is depleted after 10 attacks.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
